# A small windmill: a post and four sails that turn. Its parts are the groups post and sails; windmill.rig gives
# their pivots and the animation. y points up here, as in any .obj; the post's faces are wound counter-clockwise seen
# from outside, and each sail has a face on both sides.
mtllib windmill.mtl
o post
usemtl wood
v -0.1 0 -0.1
v 0.1 0 -0.1
v 0.1 0 0.1
v -0.1 0 0.1
v -0.1 1.6 -0.1
v 0.1 1.6 -0.1
v 0.1 1.6 0.1
v -0.1 1.6 0.1
f 5 6 2 1
f 6 7 3 2
f 7 8 4 3
f 8 5 1 4
f 5 8 7 6
o sails
usemtl cloth
v -0.08 1.5 -0.15
v 0.08 1.5 -0.15
v 0.08 2.3 -0.15
v -0.08 2.3 -0.15
v -0.08 1.5 -0.15
v 0.08 1.5 -0.15
v 0.08 0.7 -0.15
v -0.08 0.7 -0.15
v -0.8 1.42 -0.15
v 0 1.42 -0.15
v 0 1.58 -0.15
v -0.8 1.58 -0.15
v 0 1.42 -0.15
v 0.8 1.42 -0.15
v 0.8 1.58 -0.15
v 0 1.58 -0.15
f 9 10 11 12
f 9 12 11 10
f 13 14 15 16
f 13 16 15 14
f 17 18 19 20
f 17 20 19 18
f 21 22 23 24
